    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Frequent complaints regarding staff attentiveness"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "While a few shoppers encountered polite cashiers and helpful aquatics staff, overall reviews reflect substantial dissatisfaction with customer service. Patrons frequently report unhelpful floor employees who ignore questions, dismissive store managers during pricing disputes, and rude treatment at the grooming and veterinary desks."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Spacious layout with store upkeep concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Visitors appreciate the spacious aisles, clean store interior, and ample retail displays for routine pet shopping. However, several reviewers highlight notable maintenance shortcomings, including litter and pet waste in the parking lot, unexpected early store closures, and murky water in aquatic tanks."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Broad supply inventory with quality inconsistencies"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers find a broad assortment of cat foods, dog treats, and aquarium accessories during routine trips. Nevertheless, multiple pet owners report dissatisfaction with product quality, noting poor condition of display fish in aquatics, degraded rabbit alfalfa hay, and limited selection for felines compared to dogs."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
