        "en": "Can pets accompany owners inside the store?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, leashed and well-behaved domestic pets are welcome to shop alongside their owners."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does this location provide pet grooming services?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, an on-site grooming salon provides baths and haircuts, though reviews emphasize communicating specific grooming requests clearly."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is curbside pickup reliable at this PetSmart?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Curbside pickup is nominally offered, but reviewers report occasional delays and recommend entering the store if wait times are long."
      },
